# Manual verification only (not a registered CTest case): captures the live window's drawn HUD
# and construction-menu chrome for a pixel-exact diff against the oracle (tools/ui_layout.py
# compose_screen), the same way ui_mock_compare.py already checks the standalone CPU composer.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
screenshot hud_idle_live
key b
wait frames 5
screenshot construction_public_live
quit
